  "idea": "LocalSend: share files between iPhone, Android, and PC with zero cables",
  "text": "Here is the AirDrop alternative that works across Windows, Mac, iOS, and Android seamlessly. Apple AirDrop locks you into one ecosystem, leaving cross-platform collaboration completely stranded. Bluetooth sharing between competing operating systems is notoriously slow and frequently disconnects midway through large transfers. LocalSend bridges the gap by discovering nearby devices automatically on your local network protocol. You transfer production files between mixed hardware setups friction-free.",
